digraph account_payable_process_8 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the vendor accounting department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the vendor accounting department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"gather the vendors invoice" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" -> "gather the vendors invoice"
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_2IU2" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"gather the vendors invoice" -> "OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_2IU2"
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_2IU2" -> "enter the invoice into the accounts payable account"
		"schedule the payment" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_2IU2" -> "schedule the payment"
		"OR_JOIN--4. Payment_2IU2" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_2IU2"
		"schedule the payment" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_2IU2"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the vendor accounting department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"OR_JOIN--4. Payment_2IU2" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the vendor accounting department. 
Once sending to the vendor accounting department occurs, creating a receiving report should be done. 
When creating a receiving report is completed, you need to gather the vendors invoice.
Once gathering the vendors invoice occurs, one or more of the following paths should be executed: entering the invoice into the accounts payable account, scheduling the payment. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the Account payable process. It starts when you send the vendor accounting department.
Once the sending to the vendor accounting department takes place, a receiving report should be created.
When you complete the creating a receiving report, you need to collect the vendor invoice.
Once the payment of vendors is collected, one or more of the following paths should be executed: The invoice is entered into the account payable and a payment schedule is scheduled.
The process is now concluded.
"
}
